{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_pantheon": {
        "skill": "【附加包】近处向前突刺，远处蓄力后掷出长矛，对线上的敌人造成<#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>（掷出时第一个之后减半）；目标生命低于20%时伤害翻倍。强化：额外<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】跃向敌方英雄，造成其7%最大生命的伤害并<#ef5350ff>晕眩1秒<>；强化：下次普攻连刺3下。<#ff9028ff>神佑枪阵<>：举盾<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>，免疫控制和正面伤害，连刺前方后盾击造成<#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。",
        "ult": "【附加包】下蹲<#ffb900ff>1秒<>后跃起，落向敌人最密集的战场：长矛先砸下造成<#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>并减速50%，落地造成<#a974ffff>300魔法伤害<>（边缘减半），叠满被动。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_pantheon": {
        "skill": "【擴充包】近處向前突刺，遠處蓄力後擲出長矛，對線上的敵人造成<#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>（擲出時第一個之後減半）；目標生命低於20%時傷害翻倍。強化：額外<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>。",
        "skill2": "【擴充包】躍向敵方英雄，造成其7%最大生命的傷害並<#ef5350ff>暈眩1秒<>；強化：下次普攻連刺3下。<#ff9028ff>聖盾猛襲<>：舉盾<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>，免疫控制和正面傷害，連刺前方後盾擊造成<#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>。",
        "ult": "【擴充包】蹲伏<#ffb900ff>1秒<>後躍起，落向敵人最密集的戰場：長矛先砸下造成<#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>並緩速50%，落地造成<#a974ffff>300魔法傷害<>（邊緣減半），疊滿被動。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_pantheon": {
        "skill": "[Add-on] Thrusts at a near target, or charges and throws the spear at a far one, dealing <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies on the line (a throw: half after the first); double below 20% health. Empowered: <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> more.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Leaps at an enemy champion, dealing 7% of its max health and <#ef5350ff>stunning it 1s<>; empowered: his next attack strikes 3 times. <#ff9028ff>Aegis Assault<>: raises the shield <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>, immune to crowd control and to damage from the front, stabbing ahead, then bashes for <#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Crouches <#ffb900ff>1s<>, leaps and falls where the most enemies fight: his spear strikes first for <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and a 50% slow, then the landing deals <#a974ffff>300 magic damage<> (half at the edge) and fills Mortal Will."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_pantheon": {
        "skill": "[확장] 가까우면 앞으로 찌르고, 멀면 힘을 모아 창을 던져 선 위의 적에게 <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>의 <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>(던질 때 첫 적 이후 절반); 체력 20% 미만이면 두 배. 강화: <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> 추가.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 적 챔피언에게 도약해 최대 체력의 7% 피해와 <#ef5350ff>1초 기절<>; 강화: 다음 기본 공격 3연타. <#ff9028ff>방패 돌격<>: <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> 방패를 들어 군중 제어와 정면 피해 면역, 앞을 찌른 뒤 방패로 <#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>의 <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>.",
        "ult": "[확장] <#ffb900ff>1초<> 웅크렸다 도약해 적이 가장 많은 곳에 떨어집니다: 창이 먼저 <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>의 <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>와 50% 둔화, 착지 시 <#a974ffff>300 마법 피해<>(가장자리 절반), 패시브 최대."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_pantheon": {
        "skill": "【拡張】近くなら前へ突き、遠ければ溜めて槍を投げ、線上の敵に<#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>（投擲は最初の敵以降半減）。体力20%未満なら2倍。強化：<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>追加。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】敵チャンピオンへ跳び、最大体力の7%のダメージと<#ef5350ff>1秒スタン<>。強化：次の通常攻撃が3連撃。<#ff9028ff>イージスの猛攻<>：<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>盾を構え、CCと正面のダメージを無効、前方を突いた後に盾で<#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>。",
        "ult": "【拡張】<#ffb900ff>1秒<>身を屈めて跳び、敵が最も多い戦場へ落下：槍が先に<#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>と50%スロウ、着地で<#a974ffff>300の魔法ダメージ<>（外側は半減）、パッシブ最大。"
      }
    }
  }
}
